{
  "_about": "TAH-15 v3 todos screen: Active and Done cards, add, Done/Undo, edit and delete via the row menu. Seeds and server checks use /v1/todos (string ids). The app seeds Buy milk, Write report, Call dentist, so no whole-list counts are asserted. Per-row testids are shared across rows and the lists are oldest first, so Active-row actions take the newest row (nth -1, our seeded one) and Done-row scenarios mark their todo Done via the API and act on the first Done row (nth 0). Empty and error states are not covered: the app always seeds todos and the /v1 API cannot be made to fail from a suite. Assumes serial runs (parallelism 1) and no leftover completed rows.",
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "run_id": "todos-v3",
  "config": {
    "base_url": "http://localhost:3000",
    "parallelism": 1,
    "video": "fail",
    "default_timeout_ms": 15000
  },
  "namespace": {
    "run_id": "todos-v3",
    "email": "qa+todos-v3@example.com",
    "tag": "QA RUN todos-v3"
  },
